              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me pyeradek wiye aboŋwen me loc pa Ajaria kabaka me Juda, en aye Menakem wod pa Gad ocako iye loyo jo Icrael, ci obedo ka loc pi mwaka apar ki i Camaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En obedo ka tiyo gin ma nen marac i wan Rwot; i kare me kwone ducu pe obwoto lubo kit bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubalo-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Pul kabaka me Aciria obino ka monyo lobo; ci Menakem omiyo bot Pul ryal ma romo talanta alip acel, wek okonye pi miye tek me moko kerre maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lim meno Menakem ojogo ki bot jo Icrael ma lulonyo ducu, kun ŋat acel acel oculo cekel me ryal pyerabic me amiya bot kabaka me Aciria, omiyo kabaka me Aciria odok cen, pe obedo i lobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok kom Menakem mudoŋŋe ducu, ki gin ducu ma yam otiyo, gityeko coyone i buk me Tekwaro ptl Luker me Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menakem oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci wode Pekakia aye oleyo ka tyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.22",
